(5-Ingredient Dinners: Short Grocery List, Real Dinner) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(By the Trillion Man Outreach kitchen crew Updated October 8, 2026) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Fewer ingredients means a shorter list, less chopping and less money spent on things) Tj
T*
(that rot in the crisper. These dinners use five main ingredients, not counting oil, salt) Tj
T*
(and pepper. Here are seven to try and the formula to invent your own.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The five-ingredient formula) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Pick one starch, one protein, one vegetable, one flavor booster and one binder or) Tj
T*
(topping, like cheese or sauce. Oil, salt and pepper are free.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Seven dinners) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Black bean sweet potatoes) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Sweet potatoes, black beans, cheese, salsa. Microwave the potatoes 6 to 8 minutes, split) Tj
T*
(and top. Here is the) Tj
T*
(full recipe) Tj
T*
(. \(Four ingredients plus an optional topping.\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Pesto chicken pasta) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Pasta, pesto, cherry tomatoes, parmesan and shredded rotisserie chicken. Boil the pasta,) Tj
T*
(stir in pesto with a splash of pasta water, then fold in the rest.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Egg fried rice) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Cooked rice, eggs, frozen peas and carrots, soy sauce, oil. Cold rice works best. See) Tj
T*
(the) Tj
T*
(full recipe) Tj
T*
(.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Sheet-pan sausage and veggies) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Fully cooked sausage, baby potatoes, broccoli, oil, garlic powder. Roast at 425 F. More) Tj
T*
(in) Tj
T*
(easy sheet-pan dinners) Tj
T*
(.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Salsa chicken) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Chicken breasts, salsa, taco seasoning, black beans, tortillas. Slow cook on low 6 to 7) Tj
T*
